ny P, Hamer J, Luxton-Reilly A, Purchase H. In: Proceeding of the fourth international workshop on Computing education research: 06–07 September 2008; Sydney. Caspersen ME, editor. New York: Association for Computing Machinery; 2008. PeerWise: students sharing their multiple choice questions; pp. 51–58. [ Google Scholar ] Lernzielkatalog Klinik und Poliklinik für Anästhesiologie und Intensivtherapie. http://www.kai-uniklinik-leipzig.de/index.php/de/fuer-studenten/lernzielkatalog . Kern DE, Thomas PA, Howard DM, Bass EB. Curriculum development for medical education. A six-step approach. Baltimore and London: The John Hopkins University Press; 1998. [ Google Scholar ] Selby C, Osman L, Davis M, Lee M. How to do it: set up and run an objective structured clinical exam. BMJ. 1995;310:1187–1190. doi: 10.1136/bmj.310.6988.1187. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Nickendei C, Jünger J. OSCE - hands on instructions for the implementation of an objective structured clinical examination. GMS Z Med Ausbild. 2006;23:1–8. [ Google Scholar ] Wilkinson TJ, Wells JE, Bushnell JA. Using a diary to quantify learning activities. Med Educ. 2005;39:657–664. doi: 10.1111/j.1365-2929.2005.02196.x. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Cilliers FJ, Schuwirth LW, van der Vleuten CP. A model of the pre-assessment learning effects of assessment is operational in an undergraduate clinical context. BMC Med Educ. 2012;12:9. doi: 10.1186/1472-6920-12-9. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Blume JH, Perleth M, Busse R. What does the objective structured clinical examination cost? GMS Z Med Ausbild. 2000;17:12–17. [ Google Scholar ] Fischer MR. Objective structured clinical examination (OSCE). How to do it seriously despite scarce resources? GMS Z Med Ausbild. 2007;24:145. [ Google Scholar ] Biggs J. Teaching for quality learning at university – What the student does. 1. Buckingham: SRHE/Open University Press; 1999. [ Google Scholar ]',311,'2025-10-15 