INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(5265,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7094904','Year in review in Intensive Care Medicine, 2008: I. Brain injury and neurology, renal failure and endocrinology, metabolism and nutrition, sepsis, infections and pneumonia.','Antonelli M, Azoulay E, Bonten M, Chastre J, Citerio G, Conti G, De Backer D, Lemaire F, Gerlach H, Groeneveld J, Hedenstierna G, Macrae D, Mancebo J, Maggiore SM, Mebazaa A, Metnitz P, Pugin J, Wernerman J, Zhang H.','2008','endopeptidases cleave proteoglycans proform timps gelatinases gelatinases gelatinases ecf ecf sahuquillo ecf gelatinases ecf gelatinases hicp mauritz mauritz salvageability salvageability onsd onsd onsd onsd stocchetti hicp hyperventilation decompressive craniectomy hicp mannitol hicp hicp hyperventilation brainit brainit abgs hyperventilation hyperventilation hyperventilation hyperventilation hyperventilation maiya nicem neuromonitoring pbro pbro microdialysis schlenk microdialysis microdialysate legriel morandi romanic disorganized narcotics narcotic plaschke icdsc sedations rass soja rass sometime brimioulle antidiuretic csws csws hyponatremic hyponatremic csws hausfater exertional heatstroke heatstroke heatstroke heatstroke corticus vinclair 11β deoxycortiol waned cheyron hyperreninemic hypoaldosteronism gluco mineralo corticoids hyperreninemic hypoaldosteronism rra rra rra hyperreninemic hypoaldosteronism hyperreninemic hypoaldosteronism intraabdominal intraabdominal malbrain spiegelberg cimon hydrostatic container heemskerk guanylate polymyxin scavenge cantaluppi proapoptotic pmx proapoptotic resuming oliguria nicely hemofilter extracorporal azotemic antithrombin hemofilter lanquetot hemofilter honiden pachler vogelzang lapichino dimethylarginine dimethylarginine ornithine transcarbamylase unconsciousness panlaqui hemodia synchronization scintigraphic cumulated underfeeding desachy prokinetic imds marik imds imds imds friesecke eicosapentaenoic docosahexaenoic resolvin protectin lighte